# UI Component Library

All components are in `src/components/ui/` and built on Radix UI primitives. Import from `@/components/ui/<name>`.

## Available Components

### Button
```tsx
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";

<Button variant="default" size="default" loading={false}>Label</Button>

// variants: "default" | "destructive" | "outline" | "secondary" | "ghost" | "link"
// sizes:    "default" | "sm" | "lg" | "xl" | "icon"
// loading:  shows spinner, disables button
```

### Input
```tsx
import { Input } from "@/components/ui/input";

<Input
  type="text"
  placeholder="..."
  error={!!errors.field}       // red border when true
  startAdornment={<Icon />}   // left content
  endAdornment={<Icon />}     // right content (e.g. show/hide password)
/>
```

### Card
```tsx
import { Card, CardHeader, CardTitle, CardDescription, CardContent, CardFooter } from "@/components/ui/card";

<Card>
  <CardHeader>
    <CardTitle>Title</CardTitle>
    <CardDescription>Subtitle</CardDescription>
  </CardHeader>
  <CardContent>content</CardContent>
</Card>
```

### Badge
```tsx
import { Badge } from "@/components/ui/badge";

// variants: "default" | "secondary" | "destructive" | "outline"
//         | "success" | "warning" | "info" | "draft"
<Badge variant="success">Approved</Badge>
```

### Select (Radix)
```tsx
import { Select, SelectTrigger, SelectValue, SelectContent, SelectItem } from "@/components/ui/select";

<Select value={value} onValueChange={setValue}>
  <SelectTrigger error={!!error}><SelectValue placeholder="Choose…" /></SelectTrigger>
  <SelectContent>
    <SelectItem value="opt1">Option 1</SelectItem>
  </SelectContent>
</Select>
```

### Tabs (Radix)
```tsx
import { Tabs, TabsList, TabsTrigger, TabsContent } from "@/components/ui/tabs";

<Tabs defaultValue="tab1">
  <TabsList>
    <TabsTrigger value="tab1">Tab 1</TabsTrigger>
  </TabsList>
  <TabsContent value="tab1">Content</TabsContent>
</Tabs>
```

### Other Components
| Component | Import | Notes |
|-----------|--------|-------|
| `Checkbox` | `@/components/ui/checkbox` | Radix, use with Controller |
| `Textarea` | `@/components/ui/textarea` | has `error` prop |
| `Label` | `@/components/ui/label` | Radix |
| `Progress` | `@/components/ui/progress` | `value` 0–100 |
| `Separator` | `@/components/ui/separator` | horizontal/vertical |
| `Avatar` + `AvatarFallback` | `@/components/ui/avatar` | Radix |
| `Switch` | `@/components/ui/switch` | Radix |
| `Dialog` + family | `@/components/ui/dialog` | Radix modal |
| `Tooltip` | `@/components/ui/tooltip` | wrap in `TooltipProvider` |

## Design Tokens (CSS Variables)

```css
--primary          /* blue — main CTAs */
--secondary        /* light gray — secondary actions */
--muted            /* very light — backgrounds */
--muted-foreground /* medium gray — placeholders, hints */
--destructive      /* red — errors, delete actions */
--border           /* subtle border color */
--card             /* white — card backgrounds */
--radius           /* 0.75rem — border radius */
```

## Toast Notifications

Uses **sonner**. Call anywhere in client components:
```tsx
import { toast } from "sonner";

toast.success("Saved successfully");
toast.error("Something went wrong");
toast.info("Processing…");
```
`<Toaster>` is already mounted in `src/app/providers.tsx`.

## Icons

Use **lucide-react** exclusively:
```tsx
import { ArrowRight, Save, CheckCircle2 } from "lucide-react";
<ArrowRight className="h-4 w-4" />
```

## Layout

`AppLayout` provides the sticky top navbar (14px height), mobile drawer, and profile dropdown. All dashboard pages use it:
```tsx
<AppLayout>
  <div className="p-6 sm:p-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    {/* page content */}
  </div>
</AppLayout>
```
